WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:04.290
Is the Twilight coming to our world?

00:04.290 --> 00:06.580
Let's take out the Clutter!

00:06.580 --> 00:09.330
Right. We're the only ones who can.

00:09.330 --> 00:11.750
Yu, can you go find Asuka?

00:11.750 --> 00:14.450
Sure, but are you guys gonna be okay?

00:14.450 --> 00:16.120
Eh, it'll all work out.

00:16.290 --> 00:18.830
Let's hurry, before anyone gets hurt!

00:18.830 --> 00:19.830
This way!

00:29.910 --> 00:33.200
So you're another me from another fragment?

00:33.370 --> 00:36.950
Correct. Long ago, I was chosen by the Twilight.

00:36.950 --> 00:41.000
I heard the voiceless call of the Twilight
and felt its purpose.

00:41.250 --> 00:44.290
Thus, I decided to accept its call
and become a part of the Twilight.

00:44.950 --> 00:47.450
I could only do so because I possessed
the appropriate qualities...

00:47.450 --> 00:50.160
The qualities that would allow me
to become one with the Twilight.

00:51.080 --> 00:52.910
You are in possession of them as well.

00:54.160 --> 00:56.000
Come with me.

01:01.120 --> 01:05.870
Earphone de fusagu hiza kakaeru
I put my earphones in and curled up into a ball

01:06.320 --> 01:11.240
Sanagi no you ni busou shiteta
Armoring myself in that cocoon

01:17.070 --> 01:21.910
Me wa taikutsu na machi o mitetemo
Even if my eyes only gaze upon a boring city

01:22.530 --> 01:27.410
Kodou wa itsudatte kogareteta sora
My racing heart always longs for that sky

01:32.740 --> 01:41.070
Mada kinou no sasakure mo itamu no ni
Though yesterday's cuts still hurt

01:43.490 --> 01:48.240
Kyou o kowasu yume o mita
I dreamt that today would be destroyed

01:48.240 --> 01:53.780
Kaisoku de ukashiyou to mogaite mogaite
I struggle within, trying to burst forth as quickly as possible

01:53.780 --> 01:59.320
Kokoro no kabe wa soranetarium
The walls around my heart are a planetarium of the sky00

01:59.320 --> 02:04.570
Na mo naki tobira o wananaki akeyou
I tremble as I open the nameless door

02:04.570 --> 02:10.160
Ruritateha no you ni kizu o mitome kaze o aishitai
I want to accept my wounds
and love the wind like a blue admiral butterfly

02:10.160 --> 02:15.370
Miageteru dake no sora nante iranai
I don't want to just look up at the sky

02:15.370 --> 02:21.200
Koko ni iru watashi yo watashi o koete yuke
I beg of myself to surpass my current self

02:21.490 --> 02:26.780
Sanagi wa tokku ni mushikago kara nigeta
The cocoon has long since escaped from its cage

02:30.200 --> 02:31.250
Here?

02:31.250 --> 02:31.870
Akeyuki High School

02:31.250 --> 02:32.870
Wait, we're at school!

02:31.870 --> 02:34.080
You, the Honor Student
Akeyuki High School

02:34.080 --> 02:35.580
You, the Honor Student

02:34.370 --> 02:35.580
Look, Yaji!

02:35.790 --> 02:37.200
Does this mean...

02:38.750 --> 02:39.750
Look!

02:46.120 --> 02:47.750
Kitta-sensei!

02:47.750 --> 02:49.330
Why are you up here?

02:49.330 --> 02:51.250
We already know the answer to that, Nana.

02:51.250 --> 02:53.580
Kitta-sensei is the Clutter.

02:55.160 --> 02:59.000
I was chosen to teach you girls a lesson.

02:59.250 --> 03:02.200
To teach you that it's no use resisting the Twilight.

03:04.750 --> 03:06.830
Come forth, my twilight self!

03:08.500 --> 03:09.910
Duplica-

03:10.580 --> 03:11.500
Wha...?!

03:11.500 --> 03:13.500
Hey, what the hell?! No fair!

03:13.700 --> 03:16.790
You know how everyone complains
about heroines that transform.

03:16.790 --> 03:20.750
"Why doesn't the bad guy just attack
when they're transforming?"

03:22.870 --> 03:24.910
Why would I ever go with you?

03:25.330 --> 03:27.950
I don't care if you're the King or
the Emissary or whatever,

03:27.950 --> 03:32.750
but if you're here, that means you're
trying to destroy this world, right?

03:33.160 --> 03:36.080
How can you do something so horrible?

03:36.370 --> 03:39.700
All things perpetuate a cycle of
destruction and growth.

03:40.120 --> 03:46.000
Like the waves of the ocean, of sound, of electricity,
all things oscillate between the dark and the light.

03:46.580 --> 03:50.830
In a way, the King of Twilight is
but one of those natural processes.

03:51.370 --> 03:55.750
My job is to ensure that process proceeds smoothly.

03:56.330 --> 04:01.250
We use Clutters to assimilate
human consciousnesses into the Twilight.

04:01.450 --> 04:04.750
So that means that even if I take you out,
the Twilight won't go away?

04:04.750 --> 04:07.250
You cannot change a force of nature.

04:07.700 --> 04:10.540
You would only slow the process.

04:10.790 --> 04:12.120
Okay...

04:13.870 --> 04:17.250
But that means taking you out
would totally do something, right?

04:18.830 --> 04:20.660
I'm not going to let you...

04:22.120 --> 04:24.540
...turn us into Twilight!

04:25.870 --> 04:27.870
She's not here...

04:28.500 --> 04:32.250
Guess I really don't know Asuka that well, huh...

04:35.910 --> 04:38.160
So you're just gonna give up, then?

04:39.200 --> 04:42.370
Jeez, everything you do is so fake.

04:42.370 --> 04:44.830
Do you even know who you are?

04:44.830 --> 04:47.370
God, you're the worst "honor student" in the world.

04:47.370 --> 04:48.830
Shut up, okay?

04:48.830 --> 04:50.750
I don't feel like getting into it with you right now!

04:53.660 --> 04:54.700
Wait.

04:55.120 --> 04:57.450
Do you know where Asuka is?

04:57.450 --> 04:58.910
Nope.

04:59.750 --> 05:01.500
But I might have a hunch.

05:05.370 --> 05:06.950
A Clutter alert?

05:06.950 --> 05:08.200
One of them is.

05:08.200 --> 05:10.120
The other one isn't.

05:10.120 --> 05:12.120
It's the same one that Seriouska fought.

05:12.500 --> 05:14.120
The King of Twilight?!

05:14.120 --> 05:18.250
I'm guessing the reason they
came here was for Asuka.

05:18.250 --> 05:19.080
Huh?!

05:21.700 --> 05:24.870
Seriouska's world was maintaining
the equilibrium, staying alive.

05:24.870 --> 05:28.700
They went there on purpose to destroy it and kill her...

05:29.250 --> 05:32.160
All because she was getting
in between them and Asuka.

05:32.410 --> 05:34.830
What? Why do they want Asuka?

05:34.830 --> 05:36.750
No idea. I'm just guessing.

05:36.750 --> 05:39.410
I don't mean to brag, but...

05:40.830 --> 05:44.080
I'm good at guessing when it has to do with Asuka.

05:45.580 --> 05:47.160
Unlike me?

05:47.540 --> 05:48.620
Still...

05:49.410 --> 05:52.580
you're the only one who can save this world's Asuka.

05:54.290 --> 05:56.700
You can have that. Do what you want with it.

05:57.000 --> 06:00.290
But if we lose Asuka, I'll never forgive you.

06:00.290 --> 06:01.790
I owe you one!

06:08.500 --> 06:10.830
I hope you don't have to go through...

06:10.830 --> 06:12.450
what I did...

06:16.910 --> 06:18.700
Wh-what is this?!

06:19.000 --> 06:23.620
I think this is all an illusion
the Kitta-sensei Clutter made.

06:24.540 --> 06:26.040
Well done, Morisu-san.

06:26.410 --> 06:28.620
Excellent insight from you, as always.

06:28.620 --> 06:32.540
However, you do not have the ability
to break out of this illusion.

06:33.330 --> 06:35.290
Come forth, my twilight self!

06:36.040 --> 06:37.040
Huh?

06:37.410 --> 06:41.160
Morisu-san just said you were
inside an illusion, didn't she, Nanase-san?

06:41.160 --> 06:44.410
While I could say your attempt shows your bravery,

06:44.410 --> 06:46.790
I think it only goes to show how stupid you are.

06:46.790 --> 06:47.870
Wow, harsh!

06:47.870 --> 06:50.160
Give us back our teacher!

06:50.160 --> 06:53.910
If you're a Clutter, we're going to have to fight you!

06:54.450 --> 06:58.370
Silverstone-san, you've grown so courageous.

06:58.370 --> 07:03.080
Unfortunately, courage that is not backed by
physical ability is nothing more than superficial.

07:04.750 --> 07:07.950
You know far too little about the truths of this world.

07:08.290 --> 07:10.620
I will now conduct a lesson on these truths.

07:15.620 --> 07:21.040
Discard your foolish beliefs, and you too
will be able to hear the calling of the Twilight.

07:21.580 --> 07:26.120
Come with me, and I will teach you
the path of the Twilight.

07:26.120 --> 07:30.540
Are you telling me to help you
destroy worlds with the Twilight?

07:30.540 --> 07:35.080
Perhaps we can allow this world
to avoid its fate for a while longer,

07:35.540 --> 07:37.870
if you decide to come with me.

07:40.500 --> 07:42.700
Let's start with you, Chloe Morisu-san.

07:42.700 --> 07:44.370
That's my...

07:44.370 --> 07:47.160
Let's take a listen at what your heart is saying.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.950
I like being alone.

07:50.950 --> 07:53.040
I thought that made me strong.

07:53.250 --> 07:57.540
I thought the opposite was weakness -
wanting to be with others made me weak.

07:57.950 --> 07:59.870
But I was wrong.

08:00.200 --> 08:04.910
My friends give me new strength.

08:04.910 --> 08:08.040
I want to be with everyone
in the Radio Research Society!

08:08.700 --> 08:11.580
These emotions transformed you into an Equalizer.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.410
But you will always be an outsider.

08:15.000 --> 08:20.660
When you graduate or find a job, your social world
will reset, and you will be alone again.

08:21.120 --> 08:25.080
You would have been better off never knowing
how great it was to have friends.

08:25.080 --> 08:27.700
After all, you'll be alone for your entire life.

08:27.700 --> 08:29.790
You've realized this already, haven't you?

08:29.790 --> 08:31.870
You're a smart girl.

08:36.450 --> 08:39.290
Next, Mia Silverstone-san.

08:41.660 --> 08:48.160
When I was little, everyone told me how cute I was,
how I looked like a little doll.

08:48.500 --> 08:51.410
But I don't want to be a little doll.

08:51.410 --> 08:53.000
I want to be strong.

08:53.000 --> 08:56.910
I want to protect everyone,
like the heroes on TV and in movies!

08:56.910 --> 08:59.290
I know I can do that!

09:00.660 --> 09:05.370
And so, you find a profession in which
you can finally be a hero to everyone.

09:05.370 --> 09:09.200
But sadly, this world is still a man's world.

09:09.580 --> 09:13.500
You don't want to be strong,
you want people to like you.

09:14.080 --> 09:17.660
You might have to fight to belong in that world.

09:17.660 --> 09:21.370
But one day, you'll realize something:
the world's never going to change.

09:21.620 --> 09:25.370
And it's much easier to get along
in the world by being cute.

09:25.540 --> 09:27.290
It's much more efficient.

09:29.500 --> 09:31.620
Kitta-chan, that's a really shitty thing to say.

09:31.620 --> 09:34.540
And lastly, Nana Nanase-san.

09:36.500 --> 09:38.750
I was always a rebel.

09:39.040 --> 09:42.580
I thought saying how I really felt made me uncool.

09:42.830 --> 09:46.450
But when they were going to force me
to marry Tomoya, I realized something.

09:46.830 --> 09:50.830
It's so important to be straightforward
and say what it is that you really want.

09:51.410 --> 09:56.830
Thus, the new, honest you finally accepted
the stepfather you always hated before.

09:56.830 --> 10:00.080
But who was it you finally accepted?

10:00.080 --> 10:04.410
Your insincere stepfather, or your mother,
who can't be independent, and has to rely on a man?

10:04.660 --> 10:07.830
No, in the end, you accepted yourself.

10:08.080 --> 10:09.080
What?

10:09.080 --> 10:13.750
You accepted the fact that you, too,
could be a woman like your mother,

10:13.750 --> 10:16.040
unable to live without a man by her side.

10:16.330 --> 10:20.200
I'm sure you'll run through more men
than your mother ever did.

10:20.200 --> 10:22.290
You'll take as many as you want.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.660
Do you understand now?

10:26.660 --> 10:29.370
Even if it feels like you've become a bit stronger,

10:29.370 --> 10:32.410
when you look at the truth of this world,
you'll see that you made a grave miscalculation.

10:32.410 --> 10:36.330
You're just absorbed in your own cliché little stories.

10:36.700 --> 10:38.200
That is all for my lesson.

10:38.200 --> 10:40.410
Study by yourselves for a time.

10:43.870 --> 10:47.000
Is Asuka really going to be here?

10:47.870 --> 10:52.910
I think the best way isn't to use words
that really drill it into her head.

10:52.910 --> 10:55.790
It's really simple.

10:56.830 --> 11:00.500
Still... What should I say to Asuka?

11:01.700 --> 11:03.500
No, that's not it...

11:03.950 --> 11:06.250
Do you even know who you are?

11:06.830 --> 11:10.750
The important thing is to say
what I want to say to Asuka.

11:17.120 --> 11:19.910
What will you do? Will you come with me?

11:21.870 --> 11:26.000
You'll really stop absorbing this world into the Twilight?

11:26.000 --> 11:28.290
I do not lie.

11:28.290 --> 11:31.330
Right. But that's not going to be enough.

11:33.830 --> 11:35.330
Bring Asuka back.

11:35.950 --> 11:38.410
Bring Seriouska back.

11:38.790 --> 11:41.200
And bring her whole world back, too!

11:45.950 --> 11:49.830
One day, I'll grow up to be
the woman he just described.

11:50.660 --> 11:54.040
I can't be a hero in our modern world.

11:55.000 --> 11:58.200
I'm going to be alone forever.

12:01.040 --> 12:03.910
Actually, I don't think that's right.

12:03.910 --> 12:04.910
Huh?

12:04.910 --> 12:12.580
Do you really think that Asuka-senpai and
Yu-senpai would ever abandon you?

12:13.540 --> 12:15.370
I wouldn't abandon you, either.

12:16.000 --> 12:18.500
Neither would I, Chloe.

12:23.790 --> 12:25.750
Dammit, dammit, dammit!

12:26.620 --> 12:30.750
I knew it. I knew you'd say that!

12:31.290 --> 12:34.370
So why couldn't I say anything back to him?!

12:34.700 --> 12:36.790
Asuka-san said something before.

12:36.790 --> 12:40.750
She said that our world is a result of our actions.

12:43.120 --> 12:46.830
The world lies in our actions,

12:47.120 --> 12:51.870
not in some cliché story that some adults
have put together for us!

12:52.910 --> 12:56.950
I can choose a different life
than the one he said I'd live...

12:56.950 --> 12:58.830
No, I make that choice!

12:59.450 --> 13:04.830
Even if I can't have the life I want after I make
this choice, I'm still going to keep fighting!

13:04.830 --> 13:07.910
I decide what my life is worth.

13:07.910 --> 13:10.450
That's what makes us Equalizers!

13:11.660 --> 13:14.080
Come forth, my twilight self!

13:17.450 --> 13:19.040
Duplicate!

13:19.040 --> 13:19.790
Wha...

13:20.410 --> 13:21.700
No!

13:22.040 --> 13:23.660
Hey, Kitta-chan.

13:23.660 --> 13:26.700
That was a real annoying lecture
you gave us back there.

13:26.950 --> 13:29.950
I can't believe you'd try to cripple
your own students' self confidence.

13:29.950 --> 13:32.580
You're a failure of a teacher!

13:33.120 --> 13:35.410
Brace yourself, Sensei...

13:35.410 --> 13:37.330
No, Clutter!

13:45.620 --> 13:51.080
And you know, you said
all that stuff about our futures,

13:51.080 --> 13:52.790
but what about your own, huh?

13:53.500 --> 13:58.330
Yeah, you were all afraid of marrying your girlfriend.

13:58.330 --> 14:01.580
Some know-it-all you are, Kitta-sensei!

14:01.580 --> 14:02.450
Wha...

14:02.450 --> 14:05.620
You're just a coward, afraid of change.

14:06.290 --> 14:09.450
If you're that scared,
then you can stay that way forever!

14:09.830 --> 14:11.830
Because we're going to change!

14:15.540 --> 14:17.080
Bring Asuka back.

14:17.080 --> 14:19.330
Bring Seriouska back.

14:19.540 --> 14:22.000
And bring her whole world back, too!

14:22.000 --> 14:23.750
Seriouska?

14:24.160 --> 14:26.370
Oh, that girl from back then.

14:27.000 --> 14:29.040
Well, can you do it, or not?!

14:29.040 --> 14:32.120
That Fragment belongs to the Twilight.

14:32.120 --> 14:34.620
Restoring it would violate the natural order of things.

14:34.620 --> 14:36.580
You're the Emissary of Twilight, aren't you?!

14:36.580 --> 14:38.290
You should...

14:38.830 --> 14:41.450
You should be able to at least...

14:43.080 --> 14:46.330
You are sad to have lost her.

14:47.790 --> 14:50.120
I remember such an emotion.

14:50.870 --> 14:54.450
Ten years ago, I, too, lost someone dear to me.

14:56.830 --> 14:58.950
You also lost Kyo-chan...?

14:58.950 --> 15:03.000
Ever since that day, I was plagued by sadness.

15:03.330 --> 15:05.250
Then, I heard it.

15:05.250 --> 15:07.830
The voice of the Twilight, calling me.

15:09.450 --> 15:11.250
Then, I understood.

15:11.250 --> 15:16.120
The Twilight needed me, and I needed the Twilight.

15:16.120 --> 15:20.750
I chose to live with the Twilight.

15:20.750 --> 15:24.750
All time was stopped for me,
and I discarded all my emotions.

15:25.290 --> 15:29.120
Thus, I was freed from sadness and regret.

15:30.250 --> 15:32.540
Come with me.

15:33.910 --> 15:36.830
You cannot change the truth of your loss.

15:36.830 --> 15:39.750
But you can forget your sadness.

15:40.540 --> 15:43.370
Will I really be able to forget it?

15:43.620 --> 15:46.040
I do not lie.

15:47.790 --> 15:50.040
Come with me.

15:54.790 --> 15:56.870
ASUKA!

15:58.580 --> 16:02.950
No, Asuka! Don't go with her!

16:03.580 --> 16:04.410
Yu?

16:06.040 --> 16:07.870
Intruders will not be allowed.

16:09.040 --> 16:10.080
Asuka!

16:11.290 --> 16:12.290
I...

16:13.040 --> 16:13.950
I...!

16:14.370 --> 16:15.540
I'm here!

16:15.540 --> 16:18.830
And I love you more than anyone else in the world!

16:19.500 --> 16:21.540
Asuka... Asuka!

16:21.540 --> 16:22.950
Don't go!

16:27.000 --> 16:29.200
I love your cheerful attitude,

16:29.200 --> 16:33.040
and the sadness you hide away,
and when you pretend to be strong, everything!

16:34.120 --> 16:35.160
I...

16:35.950 --> 16:38.160
I love you, Asuka!

16:59.540 --> 17:02.410
Come forth, my twilight self!

17:07.790 --> 17:10.330
Hey! Let me go see Yu!

17:10.330 --> 17:13.200
You cannot get everything you want.

17:13.410 --> 17:16.660
You have desired too much, and gotten too much.

17:16.660 --> 17:17.660
Huh?

17:18.040 --> 17:19.450
Come with m-

17:19.450 --> 17:21.040
ASUKA!

17:22.290 --> 17:24.500
Duplicate!

17:30.830 --> 17:31.910
Noizies!

17:40.120 --> 17:41.080
Asuka!

17:45.250 --> 17:48.830
I'm sorry I called you a liar, Asuka!

17:48.830 --> 17:51.290
Is now really the time?!

17:52.660 --> 17:54.330
I want to tell you now!

18:08.120 --> 18:09.620
You know something, Asuka?

18:09.620 --> 18:13.660
You might not've heard me just now, but I...

18:14.000 --> 18:16.000
I, uh...

18:16.450 --> 18:18.580
You're a liar too, Yu.

18:18.580 --> 18:19.410
Huh?

18:19.410 --> 18:22.830
You always watched over me.

18:22.830 --> 18:24.700
You always cared about me.

18:25.120 --> 18:28.000
Despite that, you pretended to be like
my older sister and said mean things to me...

18:29.830 --> 18:34.830
but it's because you're there for me
that I can live on like this.

18:35.200 --> 18:37.910
It's because of you that I think it's okay to keep living.

18:37.910 --> 18:43.580
Even in times when I think it's my fault
that Kyo-chan went missing.

18:57.410 --> 19:02.290
I feel like I finally got to hear
how you really feel just now.

19:02.290 --> 19:05.120
Maybe that was the first time I've done that.

19:09.160 --> 19:11.700
If that is your choice...

19:11.870 --> 19:13.830
Noizies! Get them!

19:13.830 --> 19:15.120
No way!

19:37.700 --> 19:39.450
That's Seriouska's...

19:49.450 --> 19:50.540
Asuka!

19:53.330 --> 19:55.450
I'm not gonna lose!

19:56.910 --> 19:58.580
You know something, Asuka?

19:58.580 --> 20:02.790
Everyone has to take responsibility for their actions.

20:03.080 --> 20:05.330
But that's all you have to do.

20:05.330 --> 20:09.200
There's no point in feeling responsible for
the actions or fate of someone else.

20:09.200 --> 20:10.290
It's arrogant to think so.

20:10.290 --> 20:13.120
Wait, first I'm a liar, now I'm arrogant?!

20:13.120 --> 20:15.500
Yeah, you're arrogant.

20:15.700 --> 20:20.250
You shouldn't be shouldering
everyone else's lives, but here you are,

20:20.250 --> 20:22.410
forcing yourself to do just that.

20:22.410 --> 20:24.500
It's okay to live life just for yourself.

20:24.500 --> 20:28.540
Don't you think it's a little arrogant
for you to be saying that, Yu?

20:28.540 --> 20:32.580
That okay. I'm the arrogant honor student, after all.

20:36.830 --> 20:38.290
This is the end.

20:38.290 --> 20:41.200
Come with me. If not...

20:41.200 --> 20:43.950
I won't let you take this world into the Twilight.

20:43.950 --> 20:45.790
I'll do anything...

20:45.790 --> 20:47.790
to keep that from happening!

20:49.250 --> 20:50.410
Noizies!

21:00.250 --> 21:01.370
The sword!

21:02.200 --> 21:03.200
Asuka!

21:10.700 --> 21:11.620
Chloe!

21:12.000 --> 21:13.410
Th-thanks.

21:13.410 --> 21:16.790
No problem. We're Radio Society buddies, after all.

21:16.790 --> 21:19.540
Whoa, you actually said how you feel! That's rare!

21:19.540 --> 21:20.830
Shut the hell up!

21:26.410 --> 21:27.330
Mia!

21:29.330 --> 21:30.450
Okay, guys!

21:30.450 --> 21:33.950
We're not going to lose!

21:34.660 --> 21:37.250
You bitch!

22:20.080 --> 22:22.370
Asuka-senpai, are you okay?

22:22.370 --> 22:24.580
Yeah! You were awesome out there, Mia!

22:24.580 --> 22:26.450
Yeah! I'm a hero, after all!

22:26.450 --> 22:28.700
And hey, Yu, you transformed!

22:28.700 --> 22:31.120
How'd you become an Equalizer?

22:31.120 --> 22:33.870
Huh? I-I didn't say anything important!

22:33.870 --> 22:37.200
Oh, so you said something then, to Asuka?

22:37.200 --> 22:40.750
Oh yeah, that's right, I didn't hear
what you said there at the end.

22:40.750 --> 22:41.830
Say it again for me, yeah?

22:41.830 --> 22:43.370
I-I am so not saying it!

22:43.370 --> 22:45.580
Well, we'll have time to talk about it later.

22:45.580 --> 22:46.870
Right now...

22:47.040 --> 22:48.870
we have to take her out.

22:52.580 --> 22:55.250
I am Asuka from another Fragment.

22:55.250 --> 22:57.410
Despite that, you want to defeat me?

22:57.410 --> 22:58.290
Huh?

22:58.870 --> 23:01.250
You are an Asuka, I realize that!

23:01.250 --> 23:04.750
But you're not our friend!

23:08.580 --> 23:11.080
Is that so? Well, then.

23:11.250 --> 23:12.870
Have at me.

23:16.370 --> 23:17.580
Wait!

23:17.580 --> 23:21.620
Hey, is that deal from before still on the table?

23:21.620 --> 23:22.910
Deal...?

23:22.910 --> 23:28.750
If I choose to go with you,
you'll stop the Twilight from taking this world.

23:29.540 --> 23:31.000
Asuka-senpai?

23:31.000 --> 23:32.580
I'll go.

23:32.830 --> 23:34.250
I'll go with you.
